# No fallbacks

- No mock endpoints, fake deposits, or sample-only spines shipped as “done”.
- No `localStorage` / `sessionStorage` for till, rooms, ledger, or merch order state.
- Missing secrets or WAF-blocked LLM → clear error; never invent insight text.
- Marketing must not claim live Serverpod behaviour unless wired to Track A.
- Prefer incomplete honest UI over half-wired demos.
